first-call
00:01.100 --> 00:07.300
[A close, plucked voice states a five-note call.]

answer
00:10.250 --> 00:16.300
[A lower, sustained voice answers.]

shared-phrase
00:21.400 --> 00:28.000
[Plucked and sustained lines overlap
above low bowed tones.]

interlock
00:32.000 --> 00:38.300
[Short phrases interlock.
Small, dry percussion joins them.]

wide-view
01:04.000 --> 01:10.000
[Folded bands form a shared opening.
High, glass-like notes punctuate the music.]

first-crest
01:28.000 --> 01:34.500
[The full call returns
beneath a higher answering line.]

first-fragment-return
01:42.500 --> 01:46.000
[The camera returns to the opening stitch.]

withdrawal
01:52.400 --> 01:58.400
[The plucked call stops short of its final high note.
That voice fades out.]

unobserved-interval
01:59.600 --> 02:02.200
[Silence. Darkness.]

inherited-call
02:02.650 --> 02:09.000
[The familiar pattern returns
in sustained and glass-like voices.]

inherited-high-note
02:13.990 --> 02:18.200
[The sustained voice reaches
the familiar high note.]

new-bowed-line
02:36.250 --> 02:43.000
[A new bowed voice begins another line.]

crossing
02:50.000 --> 02:57.400
[Bowed lines and dry percussion interlock.
Copper strands span the space between folded bands.]

recognition
03:28.350 --> 03:36.950
[The new bowed voice carries the five-note call.
The plucked voice remains absent.]

release
03:48.000 --> 03:55.000
[No new notes enter.
The remaining tones decay.]

closing-title
03:56.400 --> 04:00.000
The phrase returns.
The voice does not.
